        <briefdescription>
<para>RegionBegin is the first instruction in the scheduling region, and RegionEnd is either MBB-&gt;end() or the scheduling boundary after the last instruction in the scheduling region. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>These iterators cannot refer to instructions outside of the identified scheduling region because those may be reordered before scheduling this region. </para>
